#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:1
#: fd1ca4850aad4db3944eada21ab09e58
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitectura"

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:3
#: afc2d0296e264d0a88c028a18fcc5a8b
msgid ""
"Local Python modules transform explicit source records into reproducible "
"comparison artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Modulos Python locales transforman registros fuente explicitos en artefactos"
" de comparacion reproducibles."

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:5
#: e9816375f3324cc3a0a569969bcc9fcc
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flujo de datos"

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:11
#: 59196eff0ecb4641844451fd4adb6948
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Procedencia"

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:13
#: 8c75abd698544aa88c438dbf6ec17a11
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Registre el commit del repositorio, la configuracion, los identificadores de"
" entrada, el comando de ejecucion, la ubicacion de salida y el resultado de "
"validacion. Una captura por si sola no es un artefacto reproducible."

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:15
#: 95bd364d78564e8ba98dbd5e37f531b5
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento ante fallos"

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/architecture.md:17
#: 0e5742ba717842cfb9e1bb48712703da
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"La configuracion ausente, las dependencias no disponibles, una entrada "
"invalida y las pruebas fallidas deben seguir visibles. La herramienta no "
"debe reemplazar un fallo por un exito inventado."
